        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s2"
      },
      "text": "The certi)cate was issued for security company Core Security, the creators of the offensive suite Core Impact, for the address *coreimpactagent.net.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_11",
