      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "rule",
        "sentence_id": "p3_r1"
      },
      "text": "Finally, the )le is saved to NTUSER.data.{GUIDE}.dll (MD5: 48573a150562c57742230583456b4c02) and the function ShellExecte is used to run it under cmd.exe /C and Rundll32 This is in order to hide the process.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.98,
      "note": "rule or indicator snippet evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
